Gene ontology biological process (GOBP) annotation enrichment of proteins that were upregulated after 3 days of TGFβ treatment and blocked by BMS-345541 (the proteins in Cluster three in and only UPR- and HBP-related annotations are shown. Reproduced with permission from (
