Despite understanding that BRD4 is required for EMP, the BRD4-dependent gene regulatory network of non-transformed epithelial cells is incompletely understood. To help advance this topic, we recently investigated the effect of a specific competitive inhibitor of the BRD4 bromodomain (BD) on RSV-induced epithelial plasticity. We found that BRD4 activates RSV-inducible expression of major components of its functional interactome, including RELA, members of the Med coactivator complex, and SMARC subunits (
